						<r3d:remarks>IEDA is a community-based facility that serves to support, sustain, and advance the geosciences by providing data services for observational Geoscience data from the Ocean, Earth, and Polar Sciences. IEDA welcomes and encourages investigators to contribute their data to the IEDA collections so that the data can be discovered and reused by a diverse community now and in the future. The IEDA collections are: EarthChem, Geochron, System for Earth Sample Registration (SESAR), Marine Geoscience Data System (MGDS), and USAP Data Center. Meta-Search provided on the portal through IEDA Data Browser http://www.iedadata.org/databrowser .

is covered by Elsevier. IEDA is aiming for regular ICSU-WDS membership . The Letter of Agreement (LoA) is Pending (21.04.2017) 
IEDA is a partnership between EarthChem and the Marine Geoscience Data System (MGDS).</r3d:remarks>
